# Internal working audits.  These hold verbatim vulnerability write-ups for issues
# that may not be fixed yet, so publishing them would disclose live weaknesses
# before a fix exists.  Keep them local; land the *fixes* and the CHANGELOG entry
# in the repo instead.
docs/audit/
